# route: level=w7_l2_coop difficulty=beginner players=2 ends=exit after=level:w7_l2b_coop expect=wipes:0,x2_gates:2,min_checkpoints:4,letters:4
# The Beginner two-stream route of Sea Caves in co-op (designer D7; P1|P2, build/d7/bot_w7_l2_coop.gd).
# Club only, no S. The Snatcher gull over the first channel is clubbed as it dives; P2 hops every floe line
# one floe behind P1; gate 'seagate': P1 holds plate A (crouched), P2 walks the lower tunnel through the sea
# wall to plate B (crouched), P1 climbs the two driftwood shelves into the upper tunnel (letter S) and drops
# down beyond the wall; the drop into the dark half; the lake floes to the islet; gate 'dark_gap': P1 curls at
# the islet's edge, P2 drives him over the dark water with a forward strike, P1 steps on the latch plate and the
# stepping stone rises for P2; the climb to the exit.
